<title>USA: Shiloh names CEO Grissinger chairman.</title>
<headline>Shiloh names CEO Grissinger chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MANSFIELD, Ohio 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shiloh Industries Inc said Thursday Robert L. Grissinger, president and chief executive officer, has been named to the additional role of chairman of the board succeding Dominick C. Fanello, who will assume the role of vice chairman.</p>
<p>In addition, the company said, G. Rodger Loesch has been named as executive vice president of manufacturing and sales. Craig A. Stacy, who has served as corporate controller, will succeed Loesch as treasurer and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
